# Standalone campaign repo .gitignore.
# RLCR process state — per-round directories (rounds/r<N>/) holding
# direction/summary/analysis docs and PTX/SASS/profile data — stays LOCAL ONLY.
# Each round commits solution/ code; the round records and profiling data are
# not committed. The deliverable lives in docs/results.md.
.rlcr/

# Profiling / build artifacts (large, regenerable — keep local).
**/profiles/
**/*.ncu-rep
**/*.nsys-rep
**/*.cubin
**/*.fatbin
**/*.ptx
*.o
*.so
*.a
build/

# Python caches.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/

# Benchmark result logs (kept local).
**/results.jsonl
